Kua tukutahia te kōpaki pūtake mai i te pūranga kua tiakina:
{0}

Ka mutu te tukutahi ina whakatikaina te kōpaki; kāore aua whakatikanga e kawemai. Utaina anō te kaupapa hei whakahou i ngā arokite.

