Kua mutu te tukutahi kōpaki pūtake:
{0}

Kāore te pūranga i whakarerekētia.

strings.Str.Dialog.SourceEncoding.NothingWritten:
Kāore he mea i tuhia. Kei te whārangi waehere {1} a {0}, ā, kāore e taea e taua whārangi te pupuri i '{2}' ({3}). Kei tēnei rārangi:

{4}

Ka pupuri a HexIDE i ia kōnae ki te whārangi waehere i pānuitia, i waihangatia rānei ai, kāore e tahuri. Hurihia taua kuputuhi ki ngā pūāhua e taea ana e te whārangi waehere, ki te whakaingoa rānei te rārangi i tētahi kōnae, kōpaki rānei, kōwhiria he ingoa e taea ana. Kātahi ka ngana anō. Kei te tuwhera tonu ō huringa i te IDE.

strings.Str.Dialog.UnsavedMembers.NothingWritten:
Kāore he mea i tiakina. Ka mahue ēnei kōnae i te kōnae kaupapa o {0}, nā te mea kāore anō kia tiakina:

{1}

Ka taea anake e tētahi kōnae kaupapa te whakarārangi kōnae ina kua tiakina taua kōnae. Tiakina me te kaupapa, waiho rānei te kaupapa kia kore e tiakina. Kei te tuwhera tonu ō huringa i te IDE.

strings.Str.Dialog.SourceEncoding.ReadByteForByt:
Kāore i taea te pānui i ēnei kōnae ki te whārangi waehere o tēnei rorohiko ({1}), nō reira i whakatuwheratia mā te pānui i ia paita, hei kuputuhi Uru (Latin-1):

{0}

Ki te tiakina me te kore huringa, ka tuhia anō aua paita, engari kāore e taea te tāpiri pūāhua kei waho i Latin-1. Ka rangirua pea te kuputuhi i tuhia ki tētahi atu whārangi waehere.

strings.Str.Dialog.UnfaithfulSave.Body.One:
Kāore tēnei puka i tiakina, nā te mea kāore anō a HexIDE kia taea te whakaputa anō i taua puka kia tika pū:

{0}

Kāore tōna kōnae i te kōpae i whakarerekētia. Mā te tiaki ka huri huna te puka — ka whakatuwhera a Visual Basic 6 i te hua me te kore amuamu, nā reira he māmā te kore kite i te kino — nō reira ka waiho noa e HexIDE kia kore ai e tūkino.

