{0}

I hiahiatia e ngā ActiveX Document a Internet Explorer, ngā kōpaki here Office rānei hei kaihautū, ā, kua kore kē ēnei e whakamahia. Kei waho tēnei momo kaupapa i te hōkai o HexIDE.
